   "text": "**Hub dataset \u2192 Fine-tune \u2192 Benchmark \u2192 compare**\n\nSetFit/emotion (first 2,000 rows) trains Qwen2.5-1.5B-Instruct with LoRA for 80 steps, holding 10% out. Benchmark scores the checkpoint on those held-out rows with the adapter on and off. Bottom: the same question goes (a held-out row) to the base model and the checkpoint through one Template, and a second Template lays the answers side by side.",
